1727 0 obj
<<
/Title (As you read this report, we hope you come to appreciate what we have come to treasure most: the deep and real relationships being built among our community partners, including the Tenderloin Merchants Association and Tenderloin Community Benefit District; our affiliate partners, including St. Anthony Foundation, Glide, and City Hope. We are equally inspired by the new relationships forming among volunteers, and between volunteers and Tenderloin merchants. This joyful and unanticipated consequence of pursuing economic development through community engagement feels, to us, a little magical.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1683 0 R
/Prev 1713 0 R
/Next 1739 0 R
>>
