1729 0 obj
<<
/Title (SFLuv was founded to address a persistent gap in local economic development. In many neighborhoods, funding for improvement projects, volunteer energy, and local business activity operate in separate systems. In their silos, donations and the good intentions of volunteers can leave an under-resourced community with objects it can not maintain, and beauty can turn to blight.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1717 0 R
/Next 1741 0 R
>>
