<<
/Title (We are also tremendously proud of the technological progress we have made this year and deeply grateful to our generous donors. They have allowed us the privilege of serving the community without the external pressures that a for-profit tech company can feel to go faster and grow bigger for the sake of getting bigger and faster. We are free to do what makes sense for the stability and health of the community we serve. In turn, the community has been patient with us, offering feedback, showing genuine interest, and celebrating each new feature and improvement. We are so thankful to all who are using our software and who have helped us get better.)
